<title>UK: Dresdner Finance sets 125 million Sfr 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Finance sets 125 million Sfr 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following bond was announced by joint lead managers SBC Warburg and Dresdner.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK AG, FRANKFURT</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.125     MATURITY    16.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.75    PAY DATE    16.JAN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K)  FIVE</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
